#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:3
msgid "dGPU firmware flashing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:6
msgid "IFWI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:7
msgid ""
"Flashing the dGPU integrated firmware image (IFWI) is supported by GPUs that "
"use the PSP to orchestrate the update (Navi3x or newer GPUs). For supported "
"GPUs, `amdgpu` will export a series of sysfs files that can be used for the "
"flash process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:12
msgid "The IFWI flash process is:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:14
msgid "Ensure the IFWI image is intended for the dGPU on the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:15
msgid ""
"\"Write\" the IFWI image to the sysfs file `psp_vbflash`. This will stage "
"the IFWI in memory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:16
msgid ""
"\"Read\" from the `psp_vbflash` sysfs file to initiate the flash process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:17
msgid ""
"Poll the `psp_vbflash_status` sysfs file to determine when the flash process "
"completes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:20
msgid "USB-C PD F/W"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:21
msgid ""
"On GPUs that support flashing an updated USB-C PD firmware image, the "
"process is done using the `usbc_pd_fw` sysfs file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:24
msgid "Reading the file will provide the current firmware version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:25
msgid ""
"Writing the name of a firmware payload stored in `/lib/firmware/amdgpu` to "
"the sysfs file will initiate the flash process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/flashing.rst:27
msgid ""
"The firmware payload stored in `/lib/firmware/amdgpu` can be named any name "
"as long as it doesn't conflict with other existing binaries that are used by "
"`amdgpu`."
msgstr ""

